(text "Separate branch: USB -> R30 -> U3 -> cell\nR30 initially absent for first power checks." (at 317 173 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e3db8fcd-44ba-5013-9c7e-ba62506ca688"))
(text "Battery return: loads -> GND -> Q3 -> B_MINUS. Never bridge this protection boundary.\nUSB return: GND -> J1. Bulk capacitors support short transients; regulator/trace/cell performance sets brownout margin." (at 27 210 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0a43d872-3839-5364-9063-3070a0115e3b"))
