(text "Calculated: divider ratio, nominal RC time/pole, charge-current setting and illustrative heat/droop.\nStarting values: crystal loads / R9 and RF matching. These still need measurement and tuning.\nActual stock: LED voltage range, buzzer current and mechanical fits need qualification.\nFull component notes, equations, sources and lessons: docs/SCHEMATIC_LEARNING_NOTES.md." (at 24 249 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0a1ff09f-5505-5bda-b8cc-1ec4fc62708f")))
